{"id":2383,"date":"2017-07-07T13:51:19","date_gmt":"2017-07-07T13:51:19","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=2383"},"modified":"2017-11-20T08:39:16","modified_gmt":"2017-11-20T08:39:16","slug":"venue-and-useful-information","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/rome2017\/venue-and-useful-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue and Useful information"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Venue<\/h2>\n<p>SWAT4HCLS 2017 will be held at the headquarters of the Italian National Research Council (CNR), Piazzale Aldo Moro 7, Rome, near to the &#8220;La Sapienza&#8221; University campus. CNR HQ is an historical building, built in 1933.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" size-full wp-image-2409 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/1198px-Conseil_national_de_la_recherche-e1505230992848.jpeg\" alt=\"CNR HQ\" width=\"600\" height=\"451\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/CONVEGNI2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" size-medium wp-image-2421 alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/CONVEGNI2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"CONVEGNI2\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/CONVEGNI2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/CONVEGNI2.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/sala-convegni-cnr.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2422 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/sala-convegni-cnr-e1505720988424-300x196.png\" alt=\"sala convegni cnr\" width=\"300\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/sala-convegni-cnr-e1505720988424-300x196.png 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/sala-convegni-cnr-e1505720988424-1024x670.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><br \/>\nThe main meeting room booked for the event.<\/p>\n<h2>Getting there<\/h2>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.it\/maps\/place\/Consiglio+Nazionale+delle+Ricerche\/@41.9007119,12.5103593,17z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x132f619ea47b38c7:0x3bdadba52c27f45d!8m2!3d41.9007079!4d12.512548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2419 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/cnr_centrale_sat-300x271.jpg\" alt=\"CNR map\" width=\"300\" height=\"271\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/cnr_centrale_sat-300x271.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/cnr_centrale_sat.jpg 428w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>Detailed information on how to reach the venue are available in the \u201c<a href=\"https:\/\/www.cnr.it\/en\/reach-headquarters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">>How to reach CNR headquarters<\/a>\u201d web page in the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cnr.it\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CNR web site<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h4>From Rome Fiumicino International airport (FCO):<\/h4>\n<p>Take the Leonardo Express train from the railway station at the Fiumicino Airport. A one-way ticket costs 14 \u20ac and can be bought at the station, either at the ticket office or though one of the several self-service machines available. The Leonardo Express train takes about 32 minutes to reach the Roma Termini Railway Station, with trains departing every 15 minutes.<br \/>\nOnce you reach Roma Termini Station, please follow the indications reported below.<\/p>\n<h4>From Ciampino airport:<\/h4>\n<p>Take a direct Terravision bus to Roma Termini Railway Station. The bus stop is just outside the airport.<br \/>\nThe <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/book.terravision.eu\/rides?form_search%5Bfrom%5D=Ciampino+Airport&amp;form_search%5Bto%5D=Termini+Station+Rome&amp;form_search%5Bdate_from%5D=04%2F12%2F2017&amp;tripType=on&amp;bookType=ow&amp;form_search%5Badults%5D=1&amp;form_search%5Bchildren%5D=0&amp;form_search%5Binfants%5D=0&amp;form_search%5Bhidden_from%5D=824&amp;form_search%5Bhidden_to%5D=826&amp;form_search%5Btype%5D=ow&amp;form_search%5Bservice_type%5D=ticket\" rel=\"noopener\">ticket<\/a> costs 5 \u20ac.<br \/>\nOnce you reach Roma Termini Station, please follow the indications reported below.<\/p>\n<h4>From Roma Termini Railway Station:<\/h4>\n<p>The distance between the Roma Termini Railway Station and the CNR HQ is about 1.2 km. You can:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Take the bus 942 (direction Stazione Tiburtina) for six stops, get off at the bus stop &#8220;Via dei Marrucini&#8221;<\/li>\n<li>Or you can walk for ca. 15 minutes following these directions:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/urldefense.proofpoint.com\/v2\/url?u=https-3A__goo.gl_maps_wTw6ZmtFi9o&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=ZbgFmJjg4pdtrnL2HUJUDw&amp;r=MRB3eAn8zRdTR5l2NyYZdrzDXPHz_n1UHH78DybYORI&amp;m=9S6jDEprioS_xM3NNkuUMjTWajNoCiBrM-U5zwE07_o&amp;s=qojz1vm-O0OIvlnCTz19lP6QYWwfgDQK96TYEv_5a2c&amp;e=\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?hl=en&amp;q=https:\/\/urldefense.proofpoint.com\/v2\/url?u%3Dhttps-3A__goo.gl_maps_wTw6ZmtFi9o%26d%3DDwMFaQ%26c%3DZbgFmJjg4pdtrnL2HUJUDw%26r%3DMRB3eAn8zRdTR5l2NyYZdrzDXPHz_n1UHH78DybYORI%26m%3D9S6jDEprioS_xM3NNkuUMjTWajNoCiBrM-U5zwE07_o%26s%3Dqojz1vm-O0OIvlnCTz19lP6QYWwfgDQK96TYEv_5a2c%26e%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1506021332010000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFd0qOXAXZBMWx-VUWtsavrzdhYlw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/wTw6ZmtFi9o<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>From Roma Tiburtina Railway Station:<\/h4>\n<p>The distance between the Roma Tiburtina Railway Station and the CNR HQ is about 2 km.<br \/>\nYou can:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Take bus 71 (direction S. Silvestro) or 492 (turn direction direction) for six stops. Get off at the bus stop &#8220;Ramni \/ Marrucini&#8221;.<\/li>\n<li>Or you can walk for ca. 25 minutes following these directions:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/urldefense.proofpoint.com\/v2\/url?u=https-3A__goo.gl_maps_Ki8osEo2iXL2&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=ZbgFmJjg4pdtrnL2HUJUDw&amp;r=MRB3eAn8zRdTR5l2NyYZdrzDXPHz_n1UHH78DybYORI&amp;m=9S6jDEprioS_xM3NNkuUMjTWajNoCiBrM-U5zwE07_o&amp;s=KrI9P6uWYPaTK6W9D9ERsBLWpFdrFxNgLCJ_TMnjSrA&amp;e=\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?hl=en&amp;q=https:\/\/urldefense.proofpoint.com\/v2\/url?u%3Dhttps-3A__goo.gl_maps_Ki8osEo2iXL2%26d%3DDwMFaQ%26c%3DZbgFmJjg4pdtrnL2HUJUDw%26r%3DMRB3eAn8zRdTR5l2NyYZdrzDXPHz_n1UHH78DybYORI%26m%3D9S6jDEprioS_xM3NNkuUMjTWajNoCiBrM-U5zwE07_o%26s%3DKrI9P6uWYPaTK6W9D9ERsBLWpFdrFxNgLCJ_TMnjSrA%26e%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1506021332011000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH0JB4V7C9vZsuFHr1FuskheVoK9Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/Ki8osEo2iXL2<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Rome Accommodation<\/h2>\n<p>We have defined an agreement with a few hotels nearby the conference venue.<br \/>\nThe following list is still subject to change, more hotels will be included later.<br \/>\nOther hotels and different locations, e.g. B&#038;B, can be easily found by web services like booking.com.<\/p>\n<h4>Ateneo Garden Palace 4*<\/h4>\n<p>Double single use: 110.00 \u20ac\/night<br \/>\nDouble 140.00 \u20ac\/night<br \/>\nBreakfast included. Triple and quadruple rooms available.<br \/>\nWeb site: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/<\/a><br \/>\nSee map at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/rome-hotel-map.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/rome-hotel-map.php<\/a><br \/>\nBooking: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/index.php&#038;ref_site=484&#038;ref_event=417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.ateneorome.com\/index.php&#038;ref_site=484&#038;ref_event=417<\/a><\/p>\n<h4>Hotel Laurentia 3*<\/h4>\n<p>Double single use: 80.00 \u20ac\/night<br \/>\nDouble: 90.00 \u20ac\/night<br \/>\nBreakfast included. Triple and quadruple rooms available.<br \/>\nWeb site: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/<\/a><br \/>\nSee map <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/rome-hotel-map.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/rome-hotel-map.php<\/a><br \/>\nBooking: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/index.php&#038;ref_site=483&#038;ref_event=416\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.hotellaurentia.com\/index.php&#038;ref_site=483&#038;ref_event=416<\/a><\/p>\n<p>More information coming soon.<\/p>\n<h2>Visiting Rome<\/h2>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"rep-video-embed\" src=\"https:\/\/video.repubblica.it\/embed\/edizione\/roma\/passeggiata-nella-storia-tutta-la-bellezza-di-roma-in-un-timelapse\/288479\/289088&#038;width=570&#038;height=321\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe>\n<\/div>\n<p>There are of course lots of information available on-line on Rome&#8230;<br \/>\nHere is a very shortlist of some specialized web sites.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.turismoroma.it\/?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rome Capital Tourism<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rome.info\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rome.info<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.romeinformation.it\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rome tourist information<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Rome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikipedia<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.turismoroma.it\/?infoviaggio_categorie=muoversi-in-citta&#038;lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting around in Rome: bus, metro, taxi, bicycle, &#8230;<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>More information coming soon.<\/p>\n<p style=\"float: lef